#: ../../maths/numerics.md:1 b756a1d6dcf949c192a6b0dd4ac41abb
msgid "Numerical methods, and what their errors look like"
msgstr "數值方法，以及它們的誤差長什麼樣"

#: ../../maths/numerics.md:3 c631f50a21a741bf9f2900e90b76063e
msgid ""
"Three of the six methods are approximations with an error you can control"
" by spending time. Knowing the shape of each error is the difference "
"between choosing a step count and guessing one."
msgstr "六種方法中有三種是近似法，其誤差可以用時間換取。知道每種誤差的形狀，是「挑一個步數」與「猜一個步數」之間的差別。"

#: ../../maths/numerics.md:7 0e16185530f14576b53c339a739fff4a
msgid "Finite difference"
msgstr "有限差分"

#: ../../maths/numerics.md:9 b0cdab8945304ae092417ab6728b5467
msgid ""
"The engine discretises the Black-Scholes equation on a grid in $x = \\ln "
"S$ and $t$, applies the payoff as the terminal condition, and steps "
"backwards, applying the early-exercise constraint at each step where the "
"option allows it. The grid is **time steps × asset steps**:"
msgstr "引擎在 $x = \\ln S$ 與 $t$ 構成的網格上把 Black-Scholes 方程式離散化，以收益函數作為終端條件，然後往回推，並在選擇權允許的每一步施加提前履約條件。網格是**時間步數 × 資產步數**："

#: ../../maths/numerics.md a70e2592b32c4331a78bd35b59ee4570
msgid "Preset"
msgstr "預設網格"

#: ../../maths/numerics.md 1b10033886244d39bb70b7cac1d516d3
msgid "Grid"
msgstr "網格"

#: ../../maths/numerics.md 860e31e4ad2b4ef89923f179657881db
msgid "coarse"
msgstr "粗（coarse）"

#: ../../maths/numerics.md 3cd4e4ff98b04e1dba8c58ae9d9b330a
msgid "100 × 100"
msgstr ""

#: ../../maths/numerics.md 344cf51a09e141df851b0ad9196993ad
msgid "standard"
msgstr "標準（standard）"

#: ../../maths/numerics.md bcb6c53c4bb246e9be8a526b2cf684b3
msgid "400 × 200"
msgstr ""

#: ../../maths/numerics.md 02c5b47107f44e13b1ed4f2ac2a8fe68
msgid "fine"
msgstr "細（fine）"

#: ../../maths/numerics.md adc37b1098f040cfae8f576e818b2229
msgid "2000 × 800"
msgstr ""

#: ../../maths/numerics.md:20 4e771040f78f42d2abda2ac9195e07d0
msgid ""
"The error has two parts — truncation in time and in space — and they do "
"not shrink together. Doubling the asset steps without the time steps buys"
" little; the presets move both. A price that changes in the third decimal"
" between *standard* and *fine* is telling you the grid is not converged, "
"not that the trade is worth something in between."
msgstr "誤差有兩部分——時間方向與空間方向的截斷——而它們不會一起變小。只把資產步數加倍而不動時間步數，買到的很少；預設網格兩者一起動。若價格在*標準*與*細*之間在小數第三位改變，它告訴你的是網格尚未收斂，而不是這筆交易值介於兩者之間的某個數。"

#: ../../maths/numerics.md:26 1f640554f9314e828506aefea8eea5f1
msgid ""
"A custom grid also names the **scheme** and the **damping steps**, and "
"both change the answer. The default scheme, Douglas, is Crank-Nicolson-"
"like: second-order accurate in time, and prone to oscillation near a "
"payoff kink or a barrier. Implicit Euler drops to first order and is "
"unconditionally stable — the two differ in the third decimal on a half-"
"year vanilla over 400 × 200. Craig-Sneyd and Hundsdorfer are alternating-"
"direction schemes; with one spatial dimension there is nothing to "
"alternate, so Craig-Sneyd returns Douglas's number exactly and "
"Hundsdorfer differs only in its weighting."
msgstr "自訂網格還要指定**時間離散格式**與**阻尼步數**，兩者都會改變答案。預設格式 Douglas 屬於 Crank-Nicolson 類：時間方向二階準確，但在收益函數轉折處或障礙附近容易震盪。隱式 Euler 降到一階，但無條件穩定——在 400 × 200 的半年期一般型上，兩者在小數第三位就有差異。Craig-Sneyd 與 Hundsdorfer 是交替方向格式；只有一個空間維度時沒有方向可交替，因此 Craig-Sneyd 給出的數字與 Douglas 完全相同，而 Hundsdorfer 只在權重上有所不同。"

#: ../../maths/numerics.md:35 a980343d855c4a988004363271a9603e
msgid ""
"**Damping steps** are the Rannacher trick: the first few steps taken "
"fully implicit, which damps the oscillation the Crank-Nicolson family "
"shows against a discontinuous derivative. They come out of the time steps"
" rather than being added to them."
msgstr "**阻尼步數**是 Rannacher 技巧：最前面幾步改成全隱式，藉此抑制 Crank-Nicolson 家族在導數不連續處出現的震盪。它們是從時間步數裡撥出來的，不是外加的。"

#: ../../maths/numerics.md:40 697ae783d472477687a8ab0b3bd3e454
msgid ""
"The explicit scheme is refused by this build. Its stability condition "
"ties the time step to the *square* of the asset step,"
msgstr "這個版本拒絕顯式格式。它的穩定條件把時間步長綁在資產步長的*平方*上，"

#: ../../maths/numerics.md:43 0d185a27ff804da5bbf4d158e33b9751
#, python-brace-format
msgid "\\Delta t \\lesssim \\frac{(\\Delta x)^2}{\\sigma^2},"
msgstr ""

#: ../../maths/numerics.md:45 b24fb820af1a4ac49f8ebaadebe7fbd4
msgid ""
"and $\\Delta x$ belongs to a mesher QuantLib builds inside the engine, so"
" neither the client nor the service can say in advance which grids are "
"safe. What an unstable run returns is not an error but a number: 2.4e140 "
"at 100 × 200 on a half-year vanilla, a NaN at 400 × 200."
msgstr "而 $\\Delta x$ 屬於 QuantLib 在引擎內部自建的網格產生器，因此用戶端與服務都無法事先斷定哪些網格是安全的。不穩定的計算回傳的不是錯誤而是一個數字：半年期一般型在 100 × 200 是 2.4e140，在 400 × 200 是 NaN。"

#: ../../maths/numerics.md:50 2e9d7dd3be2642d4bf19a7dbc1155047
msgid ""
"For a barrier, put the barrier *on* a grid line if you can — the standard"
" failure mode of an FD barrier price is a barrier that falls between two "
"nodes, and it shows up as a price that jumps as the grid is refined "
"rather than settling."
msgstr "對障礙商品而言，可以的話就把障礙擺*在*格線上——有限差分障礙價格的典型失效模式，就是障礙落在兩個節點之間，症狀是價格隨網格加細而跳動，而不是穩定下來。"

#: ../../maths/numerics.md:55 05ab53010cea47d3b1c1241ac1547243
msgid "Monte Carlo"
msgstr "蒙地卡羅"

#: ../../maths/numerics.md:57 750992219b9140cc8f28d47eff3b8852
msgid "The estimator is the discounted sample mean of the payoff:"
msgstr "估計量是收益的折現樣本平均："

#: ../../maths/numerics.md:59 e74f0c092d81488ead544938c9e3e883
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"\\hat V = "
"e^{-rT}\\,\\frac{1}{N}\\sum_{i=1}^{N}\\text{payoff}\\big(S^{(i)}\\big),\n"
"\\qquad\n"
"S_T^{(i)} = S_0 \\exp\\!\\left(\\left(r - q - "
"\\tfrac{\\sigma^2}{2}\\right)T + \\sigma\\sqrt{T}\\,Z_i\\right)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../maths/numerics.md:63 03028817c7394cc094b0de0b069568a6
msgid "Its standard error is"
msgstr "它的標準誤為"

#: ../../maths/numerics.md:65 258a0d6155e544b7b03e0abba316aaa1
msgid "\\text{s.e.} = \\frac{s}{\\sqrt{N}},"
msgstr ""

#: ../../maths/numerics.md:67 282cbead9e3a4f29bb54d7589a4bb1b4
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"where $s$ is the sample standard deviation of the discounted payoffs. "
"That is what the **error estimate** on the result is, and the two things "
"to remember about it are that it is a *standard error, not a bound* — the"
" true value is outside $\\pm 1$ s.e. about a third of the time — and that"
" it shrinks as $1/\\sqrt{N}$, so a decimal place costs a hundredfold in "
"paths."
msgstr "其中 $s$ 是折現收益的樣本標準差。這就是結果上那個**誤差估計**，關於它要記住兩件事：它是*標準誤，不是界限*——真值大約有三分之一的時間落在 $\\pm 1$ 個標準誤之外——而且它以 $1/\\sqrt{N}$ 縮小，因此多一位小數要付出一百倍的路徑數。"

#: ../../maths/numerics.md:73 58bb861dd935485898470fe7d9689d9a
msgid ""
"**Path dependence needs steps.** A European payoff only needs the "
"terminal value, so one step is enough and the simulation is exact. A "
"barrier or an Asian needs the path, and then the *steps per year* setting"
" introduces a second error: a discretely monitored simulation misses "
"barrier crossings between steps, which biases a knock-out price upwards. "
"More steps, or a control variate, is the answer; more paths is not."
msgstr "**路徑相依需要步數。**歐式收益只需要期末值，因此一步就夠，模擬是精確的。障礙或亞式需要整條路徑，這時*每年步數*設定引入了第二種誤差：離散觀察的模擬會漏掉步與步之間的障礙穿越，使敲出價格偏高。解法是加步數或用控制變量；加路徑數不是。"

#: ../../maths/numerics.md:80 5ca3d32052d3486bb0461a669f604bf1
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"**Control variates.** The arithmetic Asian engine can subtract the "
"simulation error of the *geometric* Asian, whose value is known in closed"
" form ({doc}`exotics`). The two averages are highly correlated, so the "
"variance of the difference is far smaller than the variance of either. It"
" is the single best-value setting on `McParameters`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../maths/numerics.md:86 697f376e9f4a41ea9226f74350482beb
msgid "Reproducibility, and why batching changes the number"
msgstr "可重現性，以及分批為什麼會改變數字"

#: ../../maths/numerics.md:88 42de9542cbb147ff92abf21fef92bba1
msgid ""
"The seed must be non-zero — QuantLib otherwise seeds from the clock, and "
"the same request would price differently every time."
msgstr "亂數種子不得為零——否則 QuantLib 會以時鐘取種，同一個請求每次都會算出不同的價格。"

#: ../../maths/numerics.md:91 bc978077a1094054b10df236b71452e2
msgid ""
"Asking for progress switches the engine to a **batched** path: the run is"
" split into batches with seeds derived per batch, and the results "
"accumulated on the service's side. That draws from the random number "
"stream in a different order from one run of the same total, so the answer"
" differs. Measured on the reference trade at one seed and sample count:"
msgstr "要求回報進度會把引擎切換到**分批**路徑：整段計算被切成多個批次，每批以衍生種子取數，結果在服務端累加。那從亂數流中取值的順序，與同樣總量的一次跑並不相同，所以答案不同。在基準交易上以同一組種子與樣本數實測："

#: ../../maths/numerics.md cb42ea525c4648408c6ba11964d8adc7
msgid "Run"
msgstr "跑法"

#: ../../maths/numerics.md f5833ddf34294efea523d04d2edecc5d
msgid "Price"
msgstr "價格"

#: ../../maths/numerics.md f4a911aa2b6849b48ac06df045fdb2c7
msgid "single shot"
msgstr "單次"

#: ../../maths/numerics.md 35e031e9da9c4753bb500e12a1a76fcc
msgid "9.288545"
msgstr ""

#: ../../maths/numerics.md 49a98461a6f247bbb4d2b4c747af0723
msgid "batched"
msgstr "分批"

#: ../../maths/numerics.md 50232407798d4005beb281b34ecde109
msgid "9.307731 ± 0.031144"
msgstr ""

#: ../../maths/numerics.md a48d128720a74181936be715047bba92
msgid "analytic"
msgstr "解析解"

#: ../../maths/numerics.md daed7ace9e044330b658100b76a78d34
msgid "9.297476"
msgstr ""

#: ../../maths/numerics.md:103 623790905749494a85a45eb78c090efa
msgid ""
"Both simulations are within a standard error of the analytic value; "
"neither is wrong. Reproducibility therefore keys on the **triple** (seed,"
" samples, batch size), which is why the result echoes the whole engine "
"block back and why the engine echo is on the face of every price."
msgstr "兩次模擬都落在解析解值的一個標準誤之內；兩者都沒有錯。因此可重現性繫於（種子、樣本數、批次大小）這個**三元組**，這也是結果會把整個引擎區塊回音報出的原因，以及引擎回音印在每個價格正面的原因。"

#: ../../maths/numerics.md:108 1478f29a505f4c4b8f80c4fee03a558e
msgid "Trees"
msgstr "樹"

#: ../../maths/numerics.md:110 b45b42f6f8a141d89d9465136eedaff9
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"Covered in {doc}`american`. In summary: the first five trees converge as "
"$O(1/n)$ with oscillation; Leisen-Reimer and Joshi4 converge smoothly and"
" about an order faster, at the cost of needing the strike and an odd step"
" count."
msgstr "已在 {doc}`american` 說明。摘要：前五種樹以 $O(1/n)$ 帶震盪收斂；Leisen-Reimer 與 Joshi4 收斂平滑，快上約一個階數，代價是需要履約價與奇數步數。"

#: ../../maths/numerics.md:114 0452ab7669454657b2a7fa0cba7b96e6
msgid "The implied-volatility root find"
msgstr "隱含波動率的求根"

#: ../../maths/numerics.md:116 bd7a8dcff9f745a1a5ee6bd6a1f7cb15
msgid "Inverting a price is a one-dimensional root find on"
msgstr "反推價格是一維求根："

#: ../../maths/numerics.md:118 bc7155b50bd047a0aa08b5fc80ecf719
#, python-brace-format
msgid "g(\\sigma) = V(\\sigma) - V^{\\ast} = 0,"
msgstr ""

#: ../../maths/numerics.md:120 ade3c9f2f80047aa954d4ddfac1ad0d1
msgid ""
"solved by Brent's method inside a bracket. Three things go wrong with it "
"in practice:"
msgstr "在一個區間內以 Brent 法求解。實務上有三件事會出錯："

#: ../../maths/numerics.md:123 56d0a0a633724126ac726b2017bdd169
msgid ""
"**No root.** A target price outside the no-arbitrage bounds — below "
"intrinsic, above the underlying — has no solution and the search fails "
"rather than returning the nearest boundary."
msgstr "**無解。**目標價落在無套利界限之外——低於內含價值，或高於標的——就沒有解，搜尋會失敗，而不是回傳最近的邊界值。"

#: ../../maths/numerics.md:126 fbae80694a5448bfb9e8279241c22ca4
msgid ""
"**A flat objective.** Deep in or out of the money, vega is tiny, so a "
"wide range of volatilities reproduces the price to within tolerance. The "
"answer is then genuinely ill-conditioned, and tightening the tolerance "
"does not help."
msgstr "**目標函數太平。**深度價內或價外時 vega 極小，因此很大一段波動率範圍都能在容忍度內重現該價格。這時答案是真的病態，把容忍度收緊也沒有幫助。"

#: ../../maths/numerics.md:129 efab34d46a484604ac9b3d062370ef0d
msgid ""
"**Cost.** Each iteration is a full engine call. On an analytic vanilla "
"that is nothing; on a barrier it is not, which is why the bracket and the"
" tolerance are exposed on the card."
msgstr "**代價。**每一次迭代都是一次完整的引擎呼叫。在解析解一般型上這不算什麼；在障礙商品上就不是了，這也是卡片上把區間與容忍度攤出來的原因。"

#: ../../maths/numerics.md:133 312af72d0f3e461ea81bccb3e5aa0d37
msgid ""
"QuantLib can invert a vanilla, a barrier and a double barrier. Any other "
"style returns the kind as unavailable."
msgstr "QuantLib 能反推一般型、障礙與雙障礙。其他任何類型都會把該種類回報為無法提供。"

#: ../../maths/numerics.md:136 1ad32c5142c84d3ab29bd4dcc5523eea
msgid "A closing note on comparing engines"
msgstr "關於比較引擎的收尾"

#: ../../maths/numerics.md:138 47e0109e86ee4812b659612861d5b280
msgid ""
"Two engines on the same trade will not agree exactly, and the differences"
" above are why. A sensible discipline:"
msgstr "同一筆交易上的兩個引擎不會完全一致，而上面說的差異就是原因。一套合理的紀律："

#: ../../maths/numerics.md:141 2ceae393395b49f18d4b4bc093500f06
msgid "Price analytically where a closed form exists — that is the reference."
msgstr "有封閉解的地方就用解析解計價——那就是基準。"

#: ../../maths/numerics.md:142 a4bbbf1b06584820abdc6f5de27f1156
msgid ""
"Use a lattice with many steps, or a fine grid, as the reference where "
"none does."
msgstr "沒有封閉解時，用多步的格點或細網格當基準。"

#: ../../maths/numerics.md:144 44af8e9782804723a354e8acc3639ebb
msgid ""
"Treat a Monte Carlo number as a distribution, and read its error estimate"
" before its digits."
msgstr "把蒙地卡羅的數字當成一個分配看待，先讀它的誤差估計，再讀它的位數。"

#: ../../maths/numerics.md:146 8065c89e1840428e83c9645911106d06
msgid ""
"Always read the engine echo. Two prices are only comparable when you know"
" what produced each, which is why `PriceResult` echoes the whole `Engine`"
" message back on every result."
msgstr ""

